  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "9b4a5317-e137-4385-83cf-6f26761945e8"],
 "; it persists in the user configuration file."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->52,ExpressionUUID->"9ba86eaf-ed81-4efd-bec6-83ff64231db0"],

Cell["\<\
$Alias is the user's identity: SaveData and DeleteData act only under \
$DataDirectory/$Alias. GetData and OpenData default to it, but read any alias \
through the \"alias/name\" form or the Alias option.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->53,ExpressionUUID->"4297462c-1e0b-4c88-8262-52ed643e7e4e"],

Cell["\<\
$Alias is Protected; set it with SetAlias, which also records it in the user \
configuration file so every later session restores it. It has no value until \
then, and SaveData refuses to run until it does.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->54,ExpressionUUID->"a5be3e11-e3a4-4f9f-899b-243822195eee"],

Cell["\<\
Notebooks never carry an alias: identity always comes from the configuration, \
so running another user's notebook cannot write into their directory.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->55,ExpressionUUID->"845c3d61-ef4b-407b-acac-8ea2b3da6e74"]
}, Open  ]],

